1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,600
You're still trying.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,500
So why does moving
forward feel harder?

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,450
Every day takes energy.

4
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:09,000
Recovery keeps
getting put off.

5
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:12,650
When you've been worn down
for a while,

6
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:15,800
the same things
can feel harder.

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,000
How your body feels

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,700
affects your drive
to keep going.

9
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:25,350
Make recovery
part of your plan,

10
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:27,450
so your body
can keep up

11
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:29,750
with where
you want to go.
